{
  "name": "unsealed-witness-legacy-of-the-covenant",
  "version": "0.7.0",
  "description": "UNSEALED WITNESS: Legacy of the Covenant (Chứng Nhân: Di Sản Giao Ước) - Biblical Explorer RPG",
